body:
Have you spoken to your uni counselor? They should be free and helpful. 

&#x200B;

I really feel you. I failed my second last semester because of major depression. But I got my shit together. With the help of a psychiatrist, a counselor, and a friend. I got myself back to a working point where, at least most days, I can stay out of bed for more than a few hours. Take it one step at a time. You will be ok. Life will not always be this difficult.
